  "description": {
   "en": "Benihana is a young woman who always wanted to become a maid. Their perfectly pressed uniforms, their brilliant coiffed hair, their catlike dexterity when shredding on a skateboard, their tendency to smile no matter what chores they do…\n\nBeg pardon? “Maids don’t skateboard?” Au contraire! A maid’s entire worth is in their shredding capabilities. All the greatest maids know how to skate - Mary Poppins, Mrs. Doubtfire, Amelia Bedelia, Tony Hawk… and now that Hana has finally become a maid, it’s time for her to follow in their footsteps!\n\nA new serialization based on the author Suzushiro’s drawings of maids on skateboards!\n\n**Warning: These maids are professionals - do not try their stunts at home. Always wear a helmet under your maid’s bonnet.**",
   "vi": "Như tên truyện thôi, Maid trượt ván. Một sự kết hợp tường không hay mà hay không tưởng."
  },
